## Google Cloud Setup (One-Time)

> [!NOTE]
> You already have a Google Cloud project from your OAuth setup. These steps just enable an additional API.

1. Go to [Google Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com)
2. Select your existing project (the one with OAuth configured)
3. Navigate to **APIs & Services → Library**
4. Search for **"Cloud Vision API"** → Click **Enable**
5. Go to **APIs & Services → Credentials**
6. Click **"Create Credentials" → "API Key"**
7. **Restrict the key** (recommended):
   - Click the key → **API restrictions** → **Restrict key**
   - Select **"Cloud Vision API"** only
8. Copy the API key
9. Add to your environment:
   - **`.env.local`**: `GOOGLE_CLOUD_VISION_API_KEY=your_key_here`
   - **Vercel**: Project Settings → Environment Variables → Add `GOOGLE_CLOUD_VISION_API_KEY`

